1
00:00:00,380 --> 00:00:03,231
“I'll get a proper system when I'm busier.”

2
00:00:03,311 --> 00:00:05,521
Here's the problem with later.

3
00:00:05,601 --> 00:00:10,131
Every month you run on chats is a month of data you can't get back.

4
00:00:10,131 --> 00:00:13,687
Who came back. Who didn't. Which days stay empty.

5
00:00:14,167 --> 00:00:17,193
A booking system shouldn't just hold appointments.

6
00:00:17,193 --> 00:00:19,353
It should tell you what they mean.

7
00:00:19,533 --> 00:00:23,133
NextSlot keeps the record from your very first booking.

8
00:00:23,313 --> 00:00:26,769
Your future self will want the data. Start it now.
